      "message": "Why is there a special check at 256 KiB? What happens if the EC image is larger than 256 KiB?\n\nAlso, if this is needed, there is an off by one error.\n```\nif offset + program_length \u003e\u003d EC_RESPONSE_BYTES_COUNT\n```",
